      <p source="#source-247-294"><seg source="#source-247-294">うごめく　は　これ　何者　ぞ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-294-350"><seg source="#source-294-321">牢獄　に　等しき　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-321-336"><rb>闇</rb><rt>やみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-336-350">　を――</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-350-412"><seg source="#source-350-386">ひとつ　か　と　まなこ　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-386-398"><rb>据</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-398-412">うれば、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-412-462"><seg source="#source-412-462">その数　は　増して　行く　なり、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-462-524"><seg source="#source-462-492">まとへる　ぞ　みな　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-492-507"><rb>墨</rb><rt>すみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-507-524">ごろも――</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-524-577"><seg source="#source-524-539">黒法師――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-539-557"><rb>無為</rb><rt>むゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-557-577">　の　行列。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-577-624"><seg source="#source-577-624">暗き　より　暗き　に　入りて、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-624-670"><seg source="#source-624-670">かへり見る　光　だに　なし。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-670-744"><seg source="#source-670-676">わが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-676-691"><rb>霊</rb><rt>たま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-691-712">　の　なやむ　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-712-733"><rb>産屋</rb><rt>うぶや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-733-744">　か。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-744-785"><seg source="#source-744-785">相向ふ　かゞみ　の　法師、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-785-820"><seg source="#source-785-820">相映り、幾多　生まるゝ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-820-885"><seg source="#source-820-862">代　の　かげ　の　並ぶ　その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-862-874"><rb>脊</rb><rt>せ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-874-885">　よ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-885-935"><seg source="#source-885-935">その脊　をば　いくつ　越ゆとも、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-935-986"><seg source="#source-935-986">この　無言、つひに　死　ぞ　なき。</seg></p>
    </body>
